  "description": "Point Scrubkit at a folder and get back a clean table of file text + metadata — 100% offline, no telemetry. Extracts text and metadata from PDF, Office (docx/pptx/xlsx), plain-text, and image (EXIF) files, ready to feed into RAG ingestion, search indexing, and data-prep pipelines. Pluggable per-format extractors (IFileExtractor) plus streaming and bounded-parallel processing for large folders.",
